dmo0Ta1g1RR2H5aXCry1BB_PexTOX_JWXUjEUTHc6ToNXE0UFGEuIOojR_zHcbGiW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-l_giCQe6DLw5HyFOAKWQ8WG8A48wctnMTuJMrC_D_Q&oe=69B6BEB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOzUvJduf70Q7kNvwFDRBf2&_nc_oc=AdnbcvKLmIX9q1O1nGdU34p6wCr1XP9qTcrev5btImoi9Iao-V81ySA_4eewIV60aI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxenore2dohvyPhjt1ttWEjmWLgzThCG7kI12L-45dMAQ&oe=69B6C04A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9COrmpexXOQQ7kNvwEpuFYD&_nc_oc=AdnHPpdSQxiYcRK-dITF6mpWkI1y8jyhw3ImNSVorTUDPYwNkejfDcnqwgIQ15Jd6Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJW-jkTNFJIquRhJc4-XDFFj3rCAihJadcYiSArpKsoA&oe=69B6AD6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G5OEmoo4CkEQ7kNvwE8qckn&_nc_oc=AdnG-LFsixbyOhEQquAd9h5ZG9JwgB85NZ2kaKQKRAvdP6ucHBx3TYKRsIMAdjNDuhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxrX7Oi9fuCV5Th3NT-XjAbQZgq6zRv2nrGwDC5L4qKAA&oe=69B696C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oetPSGie014Q7kNvwF9vQY4&_nc_oc=AdlGeopxVcnF3239FAd0KdmKhPqkh0RO5s01fMXsj4nMQmZu-8gR4RCH5UymNqjcp_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx8yDnLs2lC6O63qpAoEzj0ryRNjN9VILsJ9SjhK6bciw&oe=69B68F18"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oTxZceElw0UQ7kNvwHwG8mv&_nc_oc=Admd-TJxi-gnxP6X0ZzsGUdE3_xlWCMe1PBEY24NoEKnD2sVVn5ZtaGq8bO4Sidl8bQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzmOGlvpLCb-AL-Z9HQ5TDQnr-GYClTSv8nHUR1Fir_oA&oe=69B6A23C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&