2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FJt3hegHPkQ7kNvwF0eGYy&_nc_oc=Admo0Ta1g1RR2H5aXCry1BB_PexTOX_JWXUjEUTHc6ToNXE0UFGEuIOojR_zHcbGiW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-l_giCQe6DLw5HyFOAKWQ8WG8A48wctnMTuJMrC_D_Q&oe=69B6BEB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOzUvJduf70Q7kNvwFDRBf2&_nc_oc=AdnbcvKLmIX9q1O1nGdU34p6wCr1XP9qTcrev5btImoi9Iao-V81ySA_4eewIV60aI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxenore2dohvyPhjt1ttWEjmWLgzThCG7kI12L-45dMAQ&oe=69B6C04A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9COrmpexXOQQ7kNvwEpuFYD&_nc_oc=AdnHPpdSQxiYcRK-dITF6mpWkI1y8jyhw3ImNSVorTUDPYwNkejfDcnqwgIQ15Jd6Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJW-jkTNFJIquRhJc4-XDFFj3rCAihJadcYiSArpKsoA&oe=69B6AD6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 